---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="请求的页面不存在。">
  <section class="not-found pixel-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 / Lost Trail</p>
    <h1>这条小路还没有铺好</h1>
    <p>目标文章可能已经移动，或者这片田地还没播种。</p>
    <div class="action-row center">
      <a class="button primary pixel-press" href="/">回到首页</a>
      <a class="button ghost pixel-press" href="/columns/">查看专栏</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
